# PBIX = backup only, never source (see CLAUDE.md)
*.pbix

# Power BI local/session state — the WHOLE .pbi folder, at any depth.
# .pbi/cache.abf is a full local copy of the model data (21 MB for AVS);
# model data must never reach a public/cloud remote. Desktop regenerates
# .pbi on open, so nothing here is needed by a fresh clone.
**/.pbi/
**/cache.abf
